{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "194e9ef8-f666-863d-a469-471617b63ddb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T15:18:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Tony Ricci. I got a water bill here that's way too high. Way too high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that, Mr. Ricci. Can I get the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty-one Harrison Avenue. Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have it pulled up. The last bill does show a big jump in usage compared to the prior quarters. Do you know what might have caused it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Pipe broke on me in the basement. Had a plumber out, fixed it. So I want to know about a leak adjustment. Is there such a thing or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a leak adjustment process, yes. It usually needs the repair documented, like a plumber's invoice showing what was fixed and the date. When did the pipe break?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early in the month. Then last month the toilet was running constantly too. Couldn't get it to quit. Replaced the flapper myself. So maybe that's part of it, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A running toilet can add up quickly, so that could be part of the usage as well. Did you keep the plumber's receipt for the pipe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:17:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somewhere. Kitchen drawer. I'm not home right now, I'm watching my grandson for the afternoon. He's got a cartoon on, so I got a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. When you can, send or bring in the invoice and a copy of the bill, and the request can be reviewed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Who reviews it? You?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take the request and log it, but the adjustment decision is made by a supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:17:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I want the supervisor to look at it. The whole charge. I'm not paying that for a pipe that was already fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note on the account that you're requesting supervisor review of the charge, with the broken pipe and the running toilet both mentioned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. That's the way it goes, I guess. Everything's a form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know it's a hassle. Would you like the supervisor to call you back? I have a number on file, but I can confirm it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use this one. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-four. Someone should reach out in a few business days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. I'll find that receipt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Ricci. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T15:18:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Bye."
    }
  ],
